   - If the maximum is reached (= there are no positive eigenvalues)
 * Maximum number of iterations :   100
 * Print level :    0
 * Fragments are calculated in their individual bases !
     The indexing of fragment spinor sets is assumed 
     to follow list of symmetry independent nuclei.
 * Fragment spinor set   1 --> C     
  - read from file DFC1AT
    - Orbitals in fermion ircop E1  :1..5                                                                    
 * Fragment spinor set   2 --> H1    
  - read from file DFH1AT
    - Orbitals in fermion ircop E1  :1                                                                       
 * Fragment spinor set   3 --> H2    
  - read from file DFH2AT
    - Orbitals in fermion ircop E1  :1                                                                       
 * Fragment spinor set   4 --> H3    
  - read from file DFH3AT
    - Orbitals in fermion ircop E1  :1                                                                       
 * Fragment spinor set   5 --> H4    
  - read from file DFH4AT
    - Orbitals in fermion ircop E1  :1                                                                       
 * Localised MO are written in file DFCOEF !!!
